  using 1 OpenMP thread(s) per MPI task
package gpu 1
read_restart rst.out
Reading restart file ...
  restart file = 2 Aug 2023, LAMMPS = 2 Aug 2023
  restoring atom style full from restart
  orthogonal box = (0 0 0) to (48 48 480)
